    <span class="badge">About</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas</h1>
    
    <div class="article-content">
      <p>Here you go…</p>
      
        <div style="margin-top: 2rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
            <img src="/images/IMG_0203-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0204-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0205-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0206-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0207-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0208-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0209-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" /><img src="/images/IMG_0210-150x112.jpg" alt="About Andy & Spacecraft Replicas" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color);" />
